      <p class="ch-dek">In Europe, herb went from about {fmt1(thThen)}% THC to {fmt1(thNow)}%, and a gram from €{prThen.toFixed(2)} to €{prNow.toFixed(2)}, so the amount of the drug a euro buys has {mgChange > 0.15 ? "grown" : mgChange < -0.15 ? "shrunk" : "hardly changed"}. The bold line is the middle of the countries reporting both figures each year, first and last three years averaged for the headline; the faint lines are the countries.</p>
